wh40k-weather-protection-generic = Stay under cover whenever possible and minimize time spent in exposed areas.
wh40k-weather-protection-gasmask = Use a gas mask or other breathing protection and keep outdoor movement brief.
wh40k-weather-protection-hardsuit = Use a sealed hardsuit or equivalent pressure protection; do not push into the front unless needed.
wh40k-weather-protection-gasmask-or-hardsuit = Use a gas mask or a sealed hardsuit and stay under cover whenever possible.
wh40k-weather-protection-emp = Pull exposed electronics back under cover and do not rely on outdoor power systems during the front.
wh40k-weather-protection-structures = Move critical machines and exposed structures under cover; outdoor hardware will degrade fast.
wh40k-weather-protection-cover = Stay under cover, avoid exposed lanes, and keep crossings through the front short.
wh40k-weather-protection-WHBlackIce = Stay under cover, route around iced tiles, and do not sprint across exposed frozen ground.
wh40k-weather-protection-WHGellarTremor = Move in pairs, prepare emergency lighting, and avoid straying far from cover.
wh40k-weather-protection-WHBlackFront = Operate in a fireteam, keep visual references, and avoid long pushes through exposed ground.
